  "reference": "Matayo 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yohana Matīīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Helode aho wigwa ū lūkumo lwa ng'wa Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyūbawīla a batūmami bakwe gīkī, “Tambala shilanga ū ng'wenūyū Yohana Matīīja, wajūūkile kūfuma mu bafu. H'ūyo akwenhelejaga yītwe mihayo ya koolecha būdūla būtaale gīkī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ū Helode hū ng'wene ūyo walī wandima ū Yohana ūntunga na ūmponya mu jeela, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Helodia, ūyo walī nke wa ng'wa Filipo ng'wanong'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yohana akang'hama ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ītī yawiza ū bebe ū kūnsola ū nkīma ng'wenūyo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose olī atogilwe kūmūlaga kūlwa mhayo gwenūyo, gwike olī abogohile a banhū, nguno bamonaga ū Yohana gīkī walī ng'hangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nose lūkashika lūshikū lo kwizūkwa kūbyalwa kwakwe ū Helode, nshīke wa ng'wa Helodia ūbabinīla chiza pye a bose, ūyega no ū Helode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo, ūng'wīla ū ng'wanikī gīkī akūnsamba shikolo shose shose īsho alanombe; nīyo ūng'wilahīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wanikī nang'hwe kūlwa kūsamīlījiwa na nina, ūhaya gīkī, “Aha nalī aha nisambage ntwe go ng'wa Yohana Matīīja, gūlī ng'wilangahe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūzwangana no, alīyo īkī walī wamala kwilahīla, nīyo kū būtongi wa bageni abo walī wabalaalīka kwiza kū shilīwa, ūkalīla kūlagīla dūhū gīkī ū ng'wanikī inhwe ū ntwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūntūma munhū ūja ū mu jeela, ūūkamuta ū ntwe ū Yohana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wenhela ng'hana ū ng'wanikī gūlī ng'wilangahe, biza būng'winha; nang'hwe ūntwalīla nina! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba bakwe ū Yohana biza būgūbūūcha ū mimba gokwe būūkagūjīka, ha numa būja ū kūlī Yesu, kūjūng'wīla ū mhayo gwenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū shihūmbī shitanò būlishiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wagwigwa ū mhayo gwa kūcha kwa ng'wa Yohana, wingīla mu lyato wīnga a h'ipandī lyenīlo; ūja kwipandī lītī na banhū gīkī akalembeele iyene kwenūko. Alīyo a banhū aho bigwa būyīnga ū mu mizengo mabita na mabita, bakūnondeelaga lo magūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūkola a ha ng'walo ūgabona a mabita ga banhū ūbasaatwa, ūbapīja a basaatu babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyabiza lya mhīndī, a bahemba bakwe būng'wegeela būng'wīla gīkī, “Ū ng'wenūmu tūlī ng'witogolo dūhū, nīyo nī likanza lyaja. Hambū hambū ni wabalaga a banhū baje kū machalo bakigūlīle na shilīwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūbashokeja alīhaya gīkī, “A banhū batī na nguno ya kūja, binhagi a bing'we ī shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būng'wīla, “Tūtī na shilīwa sha kwigela a henaha, tūlī na migatī ītanò na ndīlo ibīlī dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, “Nenhelagi aha ī shenīsho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlagīla a banhū bigashe ha maswa. Wīsola ī migatī yenīyo būtanò wayo nī ndīlo īj'ibīlī. Ūlangamīla ng'wigūlū, ūlūmba, ūshimeganya ūbinha a bahemba bakwe, a bahemba nabo būbagabanhya a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye bakalya bigeja; aho bashisoleela īsho shikasaaga, bokaja matangwa ikūmi na abīlī ga mamenyagūlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakalya baalī bagosha gītī shihūmbī shitanò, kūleka kūbisaaba a bakīma na a baana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ūshimīza higūlya ya nyanza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī likanza lyenīlo, ū Yesu ūbakomeleja a bahemba bakwe kwingīla mu lyato, batonge kūja kū nkīlo gwa nyanza. Ū wei ūsaaga alīmalīja kūbalaga a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala ū kwilaga nabo, ūlinha mu lūgūlū iyene kūjūlomba; nose wila ū būjikū ataalī ko iyene dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ī lyato lyalī kū būjiba kūle nī sī, līkūkoyiagwa mahuuli, nguno ū nyaga gwabafumīīlaga kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu madilū mataale ga ngoko ja kwandya, bahayimanīla ū Yesu wabasanga alīshimīza higūlya ya nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba aho bamona alīshimīza higūlya ya nyanza, bogoha no. Būlīla balīhaya, “Līlo līng'hangi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo haho na haho ū Yesu ūbayombya alībawīla; “Timbyagi ng'holò, mutogohage nalī nene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Petelo ūng'wīla, “Seeba ūlū ūlī bebe, niwīlage nane nize aho ūlī henaho nalīshimīza higūlya ya minzī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Nzūgū.” Ū Petelo wika ng'hana ū mu lyato, wandya kūshimīza ajile aho walī ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike aho wagūkalalīla ū ng'huyembo gwa nyaga ogoha, wandya kūlibīla; ūlīla alīhaya, “Seeba nangūhīlage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū Yesu ūgoloola nkono ūnzubūla, kūnū alīng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe wa kūzunya kūdo, nibūlī wiganīlīja?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bingīla būbīlī wabo ū mu lyato, gūlembeela na kūlembeela ū nyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bose abo baalī ū mu lyato būnamya kūnū balīhaya gīkī, “Ng'hana ūlī Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpīja basaatu Genesaleti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūkīla ī nyanza, būshika kū sī ya Genesaleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba kwene būndeeba ū Yesu, bandya kūlagīja hose hose ū mu mapandī ga hihe, bang'wenhele pye abo baalī basaatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūng'wikūmbīlīja bakuumye nūūlū ha neno ya shizwalo shakwe dūhū. Na ng'hana pye abo bakuumyaga bapīlaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
